# End-region certificates

Data for the end-region closure: at each of six radius-one tables, the representatives,
under relabeling of the flip pattern, of a finite set of region maps that holds every base
map and is closed under the end-region step. The encoding is stated at the theorems that
consume these lists; this file is data and proves nothing.
-/

